# The Turtle example of lomo:ScopeRule in the specification of LOMO 1.1.0
# (https://drpm.pages.code.europa.eu/lomo/latest/#ScopeRule), with the prefixes it uses.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix lomo: <http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
